      "english": "When I started learning Chinese, I made a fool of myself many times."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "有一次，我想去一个商场，但是不知道怎么走。",
      "traditional": "有一次，我想去一個商場，但是不知道怎麼走。",
      "pinyin": "yǒu yí cì wǒ xiǎng qù yí ge shāng chǎng dàn shì bù zhī dào zěn me zǒu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "我看见前面有一个警察，就走过去，说：“你好，我可以吻你吗？”",
      "traditional": "我看見前面有一個警察，就走過去，說：“你好，我可以吻你嗎？”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ kàn jiàn qián miàn yǒu yí ge jǐng chá jiù zǒu guò qù shuō nǐ hǎo wǒ kě yǐ wěn nǐ ma",
      "english": "Once, I wanted to go to a shopping mall, but I didn’t know how to get there."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "警察听了我的话，看起来很吃惊。",
      "traditional": "警察聽了我的話，看起來很吃驚。",
      "pinyin": "jǐng chá tīng le wǒ de huà kàn qǐ lái hěn chī jīng",
      "english": "I saw a police officer up ahead, walked over to him and said, “Hello, can I wěn (kiss) you?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "我很奇怪，不明白他为什么吃惊，我又说：",
      "traditional": "我很奇怪，不明白他為什麼吃驚，我又說：",
      "pinyin": "wǒ hěn qí guài bù míng bai tā wèi shén me chī jīng wǒ yòu shuō",
      "english": "The police officer looked very startled when he heard what I said."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "“我可以吻（问）你一个问题吗，这个商场怎么走？”",
      "traditional": "“我可以吻（問）你一個問題嗎，這個商場怎麼走？”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ kě yǐ wěn wèn nǐ yí ge wèn tí ma zhè ge shāng chǎng zěn me zǒu",
      "english": "I thought that was strange, as I didn’t understand why he was surprised, so I said once again:"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "警察听完，笑了。马上告诉了我怎么走。",
      "traditional": "警察聽完，笑了。馬上告訴了我怎麼走。",
      "pinyin": "jǐng chá tīng wán xiào le mǎ shàng gào su le wǒ zěn me zǒu",
      "english": "“Can I kiss (ask) you a question? How do I get to this shopping mall?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Once the police officer heard what I said, he smiled. He told me at once how to get there."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "后来，我把这件事告诉了我的中国朋友，",
      "traditional": "後來，我把這件事告訴了我的中國朋友，",
      "pinyin": "hòu lái wǒ bǎ zhè jiàn shì gào su le wǒ de zhōng guó péng you",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "他们都笑了，他们告诉我吻是kiss，问才是ask！",
      "traditional": "他們都笑了，他們告訴我吻是kiss，問才是ask！",
      "pinyin": "tā men dōu xiào le tā men gào su wǒ wěn shì 1 wèn cái shì 1",
      "english": "Later, I told this story to my Chinese friends."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "They all laughed, and told me that “wěn” means “to kiss”, and “wèn” means “to ask”!"
    }
